    rdfs:label "EKGF Maturity Model Ontology"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A vocabulary for organizing maturity models into pillars, capability areas, capabilities, and levels, with an example EKGF model containing four pillars and five numbered levels."@en ;
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/> .

